{
 "command": "dialog-layout",
 "notes": [
  "Feeds W8-18i (dialogs::native::dialog::{dpi, layout}); the kinds style and constants are also compared by W8-18h and W8-18j. Reflection over the internal NativeDialog and its subclasses of the PhotoReview (Shell.Win32) assembly; no window is created.",
  "A window-less dialog is RuntimeHelpers.GetUninitializedObject(ListDialog) with _avgCharWidth, _lineHeight and an empty _childHosts set by reflection (hwnd 0): ButtonWidth(ids) is then exactly Dx(50).",
  "Output per kind: dlu -> dx, dy; button_row -> row_width, button_width, placed (the PlaceButtonRow result for client width 600, right margin 10, top 5, height 20); style -> style, ex_style (uint); constants -> id_ok, id_cancel, size_minimized, ws_default_dialog, list_view_subclass_id, item_tip_subclass_id, idc_wait."
 ],
